#{\footnote # playing_reversi}${\footnote $ Playing Reversi}K{\footnote K Playing Reversi}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Playing Reversi}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 You play the black disks. Click a square where your disk outflanks one or more of the computer's in a line (across, down or diagonally); those disks turn black. When you cannot move, choose Pass.\par
\page
